flowchart TD
    A([Run ptas]) --> B[Create split terminal workspace]
    B --> C[Left pane starts guided student session]
    B --> D[Right pane follows session events and transcript]

    C --> E[Check /health/ready]
    E -->|Unavailable| F[Stop with backend connection error]
    E -->|Ready| G[Register or log in through API]
    G --> H[Select existing project or create project]
    H --> I[Enter authorized scope]
    I --> J[Enter target inside scope]
    J --> K{Student confirms authorization?}
    K -->|No| L[Cancel session]
    K -->|Yes| M{Consent to Vulners CVE correlation?}

    M -->|No| N[Create and execute QUICK scan]
    M -->|Yes| N
    N --> O[Create and execute FULL scan]
    O --> P{CVE correlation enabled?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Create and execute VULNERABILITY scan]
    P -->|No| R[Use FULL scan as final assessment scan]
    Q --> S[Use VULNERABILITY scan as final assessment scan]

    R --> T[Run installed bounded service-aware checks]
    S --> T
    T --> U[Add version-specific local Exploit-DB references]
    U --> V[Load final stored findings]

    V --> W{Local Ollama ready?}
    W -->|Yes| X[Generate evidence-based commands from findings]
    W -->|No| Y[Generate deterministic rules fallback]
    X --> Z[Validate tool allowlist, exact scope and command safety]
    Y --> Z
    Z --> AA[Persist safe recommendations]
    AA --> AB[Send recommendation and report commands to right pane]

    AB --> AC[Left pane becomes normal shell]
    AC --> AD[Student manually runs a displayed command]
    AD --> AE[Dashboard waits for returned shell prompt]
    AE --> AF[Sanitize and analyze completed output]
    AF --> AG{Valid next step available?}
    AG -->|Yes| AH[Display adaptive or safety fallback command]
    AH --> AD
    AG -->|No| AI{Verified Metasploitable 2 lab?}
    AI -->|Yes| AJ[Offer separate access-test command and confirmation gate]
    AI -->|No| AK[Stop recommendation sequence]

    AA --> AL[Run scan-specific report command]
    AL --> AM[Save JSON report and render HTML]
    AM --> AN[Optionally print HTML to PDF]
    AN --> AO([Assessment complete])
